Hey everyone! Today we get another bug-fixes update, we also prepare a very specific gift to surprise these players have finished this game once.


 Improved the movement speed a bit;
 Improved the Russian localization, thanks to the help of REDteam.
 Fixed some mistakes and typos in the texts (For example, the tips you can get from the statue in the hall);
 Fixed some issues will prevent players from getting some achievements;
 Fixed the mouse wheel issue;
 Fixed an issue will make players cannot get back the masks from the scale;
 A mystery gift.


Enjoy it!
